WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes fit the calendar.
An hour's benefit is another claim.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Zen12's seller describes twelve levels
and four sound styles.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
These are features,
not independently demonstrated outcomes.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A review of fourteen EEG studies
found inconsistent entrainment results.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The review did not test Zen12.
A free listening exercise comes first.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Check privacy and refund terms.
No affiliate link is active.
